  first | exact @GlobalTheory.RootEx.FJUnipotent.fj_unipotent | exact GlobalTheory.RootEx.FJUnipotent.fj_unipotent | (intros; apply GlobalTheory.RootEx.FJUnipotent.fj_unipotent <;> assumption)
